			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"泽维尔"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721220101,
					"content": "净化装置、备用零件、路线图，还有信标数据…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220102,
					"content": "这下应该就准备妥当了…等等，我检查一下我的备忘，再想想有什么遗漏的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220103,
					"content": "信标数据、路线图、备用零件，还有净化装置…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220104,
						721220105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220104,
					"content": "行了，出发吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721220106,
					"content": "抱、抱歉，我还是第一次进入这种地方，平时我都只是做做后勤，处理处理数据…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220107,
					"content": "最多…最多也就是用器械远距离操作一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220108,
					"content": "唉，这回真的就是…「赶鸭子上架」了。您听说过这句璃月的俗话吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220109,
					"content": "大意就是，形容让某人去做一件能力达不到的事…虽然我不知道为什么鸭子上不了架。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220110,
					"content": "啊，鸭子，多么优雅、多么柔软的生物。在枫丹的如同明镜一般的水面上静静漂游的鸭子，便是此时此刻的我最怀念的景象…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220111,
					"content": "唉，我们出发吧，如果这个装置运转正常的话，应该能不断净化它周围小范围内的「祟神」能量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220112,
					"content": "这样我们就能一起深入灾害区域了。还是按照之前的计划，您去搞定愚人众，我来搞定「御影炉心」…出发吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220105,
					"content": "别紧张，会顺利的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220106
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7212202,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7212204
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7212204",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7212204,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"泽维尔"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721220201,
					"content": "老天爷…我还是第一次不用任何防护手段就进这种地方…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220202,
					"content": "但我们居然能顺利到达这里，很好，非常好，几乎要超出预期了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220203,
						721220205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220203,
					"content": "你的预期也太低了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220204
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721220204,
					"content": "对于这位被我临时凑起来的伙计来说，这个预期已经够高了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220206,
					"content": "按照我的预期，当我们前进到大概二分之一的距离的时候，我拼出来的这位伙计就会罢工啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220207,
					"content": "然后，我就会因为被「祟神」影响而陷入昏迷…有可能是真被影响了，也有可能是被吓的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220208,
					"content": "但无论如何，我裤子右边的口袋里有一张纸条，只要按照上面的步骤处理，您就可以把我安全地带到外面了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220209,
					"content": "呃…我和您说过纸条的事吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220210,
						721220212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220210,
					"content": "完全没有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721220211,
					"content": "好吧，没关系，现在您知道了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220214,
					"content": "好了，我再检查一下它，然后我们就可以继续前进了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220212,
					"content": "现在你告诉我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721220213,
					"content": "我准是忙到忘记了…没关系，现在您知道了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220205,
					"content": "你的预期是什么？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220206
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7212203,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7212223
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7212223",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7212223,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"泽维尔"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721220301,
					"content": "喔，见鬼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220302,
						721220303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220302,
					"content": "怎么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721220305,
					"content": "但是，这个装置似乎少了那么…一二三个零件…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220306,
					"content": "幸好都不是关键部位，它暂时还能运转。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220307,
					"content": "但如果想要继续往前走的话，我们还是得先想办法把那些零件找回来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "泽维尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 721220308,
					"content": "那些零件应该就在我们来时的路上，请您快去把它们找回来吧，我就在这等着您。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721220309,
						721220310
